0..55 Comment "// `map`\'s functoriality written over the list `map` of"
56..131 Comment "// `../../model/data/recursive-lists.gandr`, a `def`: a rule names only the"
132..208 Comment "// operations of its own block, so `map` and `compose` here are no operation"
209..284 Comment "// the block declares and the rule is malformed. A law over a definition is"
285..352 Comment "// admitted when the coincidence check runs over the definitions an"
353..423 Comment "// import-connected component holds; until then the law is stated over"
424..497 Comment "// `map` presented as an operation, in `../../model/data/map-laws.gandr`."
498..500 Comment "//"
501..515 Comment "// - see: #525"
